    guidance: [
      "Forward mode converts curb and gutter cross-sectional area × length into concrete volume.",
      "Reverse mode answers the purchasing question in the opposite direction: how many linear feet can a known concrete volume place?",
      "Use dimensions from the curb detail because barrier, mountable and combined gutter sections can have different profiles."
    ],
    faq: [
      { q: "How is curb-and-gutter concrete volume calculated?", a: "The calculator adds the curb and gutter cross-sectional areas, multiplies by length, then converts the result to cubic yards." },
